        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Loneliness Advice and Vocabulary Notes</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']] },\n  svg: { fontCache: 'global' }\n};\n</script>\n<script async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-svg.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  * {\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n\n  html,\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #fff;\n  }\n\n  body {\n    color: #111;\n    font-family: Arial, \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", sans-serif;\n  }\n\n  .page {\n    position: relative;\n    width: 540px;\n    height: 709px;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    background: #fff;\n  }\n\n  .main-column {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 2px;\n    left: 13px;\n    width: 416px;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 19.35px;\n  }\n\n  .line {\n    height: 19.35px;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n\n  .chinese {\n    text-decoration: underline;\n    text-decoration-thickness: 1px;\n    text-underline-offset: 2px;\n  }\n\n  .section-title {\n    font-weight: 700;\n    text-decoration: underline;\n    text-decoration-thickness: 1px;\n    text-underline-offset: 2px;\n  }\n\n  .right-column {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 3px;\n    left: 444px;\n    width: 94px;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 22px;\n  }\n\n  .right-line {\n    min-height: 22px;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n\n  .right-gap {\n    height: 6px;\n  }\n\n  .highlight {\n    padding: 0 1px;\n    border-radius: 1px;\n    box-decoration-break: clone;\n    -webkit-box-decoration-break: clone;\n  }\n\n  .yellow {\n    background: #fff0b8;\n  }\n\n  .orange {\n    background: #f7d39b;\n  }\n\n  .green {\n    background: #d8efce;\n  }\n\n  .red {\n    background: #f3c2bd;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n  <main class=\"main-column\">\n    <div class=\"line\">Ask yourself what loneliness means to you.</div>\n    <div class=\"line chinese\">问问自己孤独对你意味着什么。</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">If you're telling yourself that loneliness is a terrible thing, that</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">it's dangerous to alone, and that you can't tend for yourself in</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">life, you have a problem.</div>\n    <div class=\"line chinese\">如果你告诉自己孤独是一件可怕的事情，孤独是危险的，你不</div>\n    <div class=\"line chinese\">能在生活中照顾自己，你就有问题了。</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">Therefore, you must change these irrational ideas for more</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">rational and realistic ones.</div>\n    <div class=\"line chinese\">所以，你一定要把这些非理性的想法，换成更理性、更现实的</div>\n    <div class=\"line chinese\">想法。</div>\n    <div class=\"line section-title\">Spend time with you</div>\n    <div class=\"line chinese\">与你共度时光</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">Force yourself to spend time alone.</div>\n    <div class=\"line chinese\">强迫自己花时间独处。</div>\n    <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"highlight green\">In order to</span> change, you must not only act on a <span class=\"highlight orange\">mental</span> or</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">cognitive level, but also on a behavioral level.</div>\n    <div class=\"line chinese\">为了改变，你不仅要有精神或认知层面上的意识，还要在行为</div>\n    <div class=\"line chinese\">层面上行动。</div>\n    <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"highlight orange\">Program entire</span> weekends alone with your own company.</div>\n    <div class=\"line chinese\">计划整个周末单独由自己陪着自己。</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">Enjoy a book or a movie if you want to avoid social media.</div>\n    <div class=\"line chinese\">如果你愿意，享受一本书或一部电影，但避免社交媒体。</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">Go to the movies, to the beach, to the mountains, alone.</div>\n    <div class=\"line chinese\">去看电影，去海滩，去山上，一个人。</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">Take a trip without any company.</div>\n    <div class=\"line chinese\">在没有任何陪伴的情况下进行一次旅行。</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">When you do this for long enough, you'll realize that you</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">survived, that your fears weren't real, and that you've met</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">your own true self and now you know yourself better.</div>\n    <div class=\"line chinese\">当你这样做足够长的时间后，你会意识到你幸存了下来，你的</div>\n    <div class=\"line chinese\">恐惧不是真的，你已经遇到了真正的自己，现在你更了解自己</div>\n    <div class=\"line chinese\">了。</div>\n    <div class=\"line section-title\">Connect with others</div>\n    <div class=\"line chinese\">与他人联系</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">Manage your time so you surround yourself with people.</div>\n  </main>\n\n  <aside class=\"right-column\">\n    <div class=\"right-line\"><span class=\"highlight yellow\">rational:</span>adj.</div>\n    <div class=\"right-line\">【人】有理</div>\n    <div class=\"right-line\">性的，理智</div>\n    <div class=\"right-line\">的;能作出理</div>\n    <div class=\"right-line\">智决定的，</div>\n    <div class=\"right-line\">理性的</div>\n\n    <div class=\"right-line\"><span class=\"highlight orange\">mental:</span>adj.精</div>\n    <div class=\"right-line\">神状态的</div>\n    <div class=\"right-line\"><span class=\"highlight green\">mental illness</span></div>\n    <div class=\"right-line\">;思想的; 精神</div>\n    <div class=\"right-line\">的; 思考的; 智</div>\n    <div class=\"right-line\">力的</div>\n\n    <div class=\"right-line\"><span class=\"highlight yellow\">program:</span> n.</div>\n    <div class=\"right-line\">计算机] 程</div>\n    <div class=\"right-line\">序;</div>\n    <div class=\"right-line\">V.计划；规</div>\n    <div class=\"right-line\">划；安排</div>\n\n    <div class=\"right-line\"><span class=\"highlight orange\">entire:</span>adj.</div>\n    <div class=\"right-line\">全部的; 整个</div>\n    <div class=\"right-line\">的</div>\n\n    <div class=\"right-line\"><span class=\"highlight green\">同义词:</span></div>\n    <div class=\"right-line\"><span class=\"highlight green\">whole</span></div>\n\n    <div class=\"right-gap\"></div>\n\n    <div class=\"right-line\"><span class=\"highlight red\">为了....（目</span></div>\n    <div class=\"right-line\"><span class=\"highlight red\">的）</span></div>\n    <div class=\"right-line\"><span class=\"highlight red\">短语:</span></div>\n    <div class=\"right-line\"><span class=\"highlight red\">in order to</span></div>\n\n    <div class=\"right-gap\"></div>\n\n    <div class=\"right-line\"><span class=\"highlight red\">so as to</span></div>\n\n    <div class=\"right-gap\"></div>\n\n    <div class=\"right-line\"><span class=\"highlight red\">so that</span></div>\n  </aside>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
